        <mxCell id="ml_module" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#6F0000;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" value="Module 3: ML Detection Module&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;Z-Score Baseline (Unit 4)&#xa;• Flags contracts &gt;3σ above category mean&#xa;• Interpretable price outlier baseline&#xa;&#xa;Isolation Forest (Unit 5)&#xa;• contamination = 0.05 [Peer 1]&#xa;• Features: amount, vendor_freq, award_doy, name_sim&#xa;• Tuned iteratively on false positive rate" vertex="1">
